  "details": "sometime after loading ion joystick will not be able to rotate/tilt vision it will correct itself after 2-3 reload. I have also notice toggles are broken while in this state. please tell me if anyone else is having this problem. I tested the controllers and they are fine and like i said on the second or third reload it seems to be fine. but it doesn't change the fact i have to reload vrc 1-3 times. and even then sometimes it will stop working for no reason. My only though process for this is that maybe something when wrong with the binding update (I'm on a rift S so this kind of makes since)",
